<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 104,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 104,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual 104,000 head. Opening trade not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower than mid-session Monday. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    50.50 -51.50	   51.50 -52.50</p>
<p>few			50.00  52.00	   51.00  53.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -43.50	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -46.00	   44.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -52.00	   49.00 -53.00</p>
</text>
